# Google Places API (New) key — server-side only. Used exclusively by the
# discovery scripts in this directory (tools/discovery/). Never shipped to
# any client bundle, never used by web/ or the mobile app, and unrelated to
# VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY (that one is a browser-restricted Maps JS API
# key; this one is a plain server key for the Places API (New) REST API).
#
# Get one from Google Cloud Console: enable "Places API (New)", then create
# an API key (no HTTP-referrer restriction needed since this only ever runs
# from a local Node script, but do restrict it to the Places API (New) at
# minimum).
GOOGLE_PLACES_API_KEY=your-google-places-api-key
